      type: 'Note', attributedTo: me, to: [guardianUri],
      'shaer:dormant': true,
      content: '<p>You have been observed dormant as a guardian. Nothing is wrong and nothing is held against you: one answer restores everything (FEP-633c 3.6.2).</p>',
